  (regex "^/[uU][sS][eE][rR][sS]/[mM][eE]/[pP][rR][oO][jJ]/(.*/)?[oO][pP][eE][nN][cC][oO][dD][eE]\\.[jJ][sS][oO][nN][cC]$")
  (regex "^/[uU][sS][eE][rR][sS]/[mM][eE]/[pP][rR][oO][jJ]/(.*/)?\\.[hH][eE][rR][mM][eE][sS]/[pP][lL][uU][gG][iI][nN][sS](/.*)?$")
  (regex "^/[uU][sS][eE][rR][sS]/[mM][eE]/[pP][rR][oO][jJ]/\\.[cC][lL][aA][uU][dD][eE]$")
  (regex "^/[uU][sS][eE][rR][sS]/[mM][eE]/[pP][rR][oO][jJ]/\\.[cC][uU][rR][sS][oO][rR]$")
  (regex "^/[uU][sS][eE][rR][sS]/[mM][eE]/[pP][rR][oO][jJ]/\\.[cC][oO][dD][eE][xX]$")
